reported.

Study 85: Nephron‐sparing surgery for bilateral Wilms' tumours: a single‐centre experience with 23 cases
  Decision: INCLUDE
  Confidence: high
  Rationale: Study of 23 patients with bilateral Wilms tumor undergoing nephron-sparing surgery. 12 survivors with 
