Study 98: Somatic growth and renal function after unilateral nephrectomy for Wilms' tumor
  Decision: INCLUDE
  Confidence: medium
  Rationale: Study evaluating somatic growth and renal function after unilateral nephrectomy for Wilms tumor. Reports on
