│ thyroid, breast, brain and gastrointestinal malignancies."}, {"study_index": 459, "title": "Ifosfamide: a new cause  │
│ of rickets", "abstract": "DiscussionThe patient described demonstrates the rachitic changes thought to be caused by  │
