│ exposure to ifosfamide has been published[4].Am Roentgen Ray Soc"}, {"study_index": 460, "title": "Renal toxicity in │
│ children undergoing total body irradiation for bone marrow transplant", "abstract": "PURPOSE Contribution of total   │
