          {"study_index": 409, "title": "Risk Factors for End Stage Renal Disease in Non‐WT1‐Syndromic Wilms Tumor",    
  "abstract": "PURPOSE We assessed risk factors for end stage renal disease in patients with Wilms tumor without known  
  WT1 related syndromes. We hypothesized that patients with characteristics suggestive of a WT1 etiology (early onset,  
